@baseUrl = http://localhost:5187

### Native session state (public; no identity). Use a client with an in-memory cookie jar.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/session

### Native sign-in (204, or 404 when disabled). Supply variables outside this file.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/session
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{adminUsername}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Confirm native session status after sign-in
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/session

### Origin rejection (403, even if an active session cookie is present)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/session
Origin: https://other.example.test

### Sign out (204; clears and revokes the session)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/session
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
